{"id":"55266516c016ab89","group":"88","path":"88/88-cor-universal-halts.md","title":"Universal Machine Halts","display":"cor-universal-halts — Universal Machine Halts","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-cor-universal-halts","aliases":["88-cor-universal-halts"],"display":"cor-universal-halts — Universal Machine Halts","depends_on":["[[88-df-universal-tm]]","[[88-thm-halting-problem]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]","[[88-df-tm-halts]]","[[88-df-encoding]]","[[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-cor-universal-halts"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-cor-universal-halts</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-universal-halts — Universal Machine Halts"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74864270657b435d\" href=\"?note=74864270657b435d\" title=\"88-df-universal-tm\">88-df-universal-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c5ec4a3797008b26\" href=\"?note=c5ec4a3797008b26\" title=\"88-thm-halting-problem\">88-thm-halting-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c5514506c707c9ae\" href=\"?note=c5514506c707c9ae\" title=\"88-df-tm-description-numbering\">88-df-tm-description-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\\)</span> (universal machine, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"74864270657b435d\" href=\"?note=74864270657b435d\" title=\"88-df-universal-tm\">88-df-universal-tm</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halts}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\">\\(\\mathrm{Halts}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\\)</span> (halting predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (pairing/tuple code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x)\\)</span> (binary input word, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal M=(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 还满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"c5514506c707c9ae\" href=\"?note=c5514506c707c9ae\" title=\"88-df-tm-description-numbering\">88-df-tm-description-numbering</a>。仅仅逐一模拟一个任意的固定机器族，并不保证该族的停机问题不可判定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}universal\\text{-}halts} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\land\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}(\\mathcal M)\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(e,x):\ne,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Halts}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\\}\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}universal\\text{-}halts} \\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\land\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}(\\mathcal M)\\bigr)\n\\to\n\\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(e,x):\ne,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Halts}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\\}\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若该集合可判定，在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 上可以判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是否会在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}(x,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}(x,x)\\)</span> 上停机，再反转这一停机行为得到一台二进制输入机器。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}\">\\(\\mathrm{HaltingCovers}\\)</span> 保证它的停机行为出现在某个索引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>；代入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=d\">\\(x=d\\)</span> 并使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalTM}\\)</span> 的停机等价式即得矛盾。</p>\n<p>覆盖条件只涉及停机行为，允许使用输出已规范化的机器族，因此与通用机存在命题中的公共有限输出字母表条件相容。仅有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalTM}\\)</span> 时，整个族均不停机就是旧断言的反例。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-universal-tm","status":"resolved","id":"74864270657b435d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-universal-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-halting-problem","status":"resolved","id":"c5ec4a3797008b26","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-thm-halting-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-halts]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-description-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"c5514506c707c9ae","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-description-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-universal-tm","status":"resolved","id":"74864270657b435d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})$ (universal machine, see [[88-df-universal-tm]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Halts}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))$ (halting predicate, see [[88-df-tm-halts]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文",